Corrected message:

Stop Paint Bucket and Magic Wand clicks baking live objects

The rasterize prompt added in 525caeae fired for any layer-writing
tool whose click landed inside a live object's bounds. For Paint
Bucket this baked the clicked object before it could recolor the
object non-destructively, so the fill went into the layer raster
instead. Magic Wand clicks likewise baked objects the wand only reads,
and Recolor got a second prompt on top of its own per-object one.

Paint Bucket, Magic Wand and Recolor now skip that prompt. Adds a
regression test for the tool-manager routing.
